## Current method

_Generated by `tp classify site.yml`._

3 tasks in scope; 1 match no pattern and are plain module calls. A task is listed under every pattern it matches, so pattern counts overlap and do not sum to the task total.

### By pattern

| Pattern | Tasks | Proposed telepatch primitive |
|---|---|---|
| Distro dispatch | 0 | typed `os` fact and a `match`, or a per-family table on `pkg` |
| Guarded by a distro flag | 0 | the task's own primitive inside the `match` arm; the flag is not a dispatch point |
| Installer outside the package manager | 0 | `tool` (binary, installed version, wanted version, source, install/update); not built |
| Per-user loop | 0 | `for u in users { let s = h.as_user(u); ... }`; the login shell is a fact of the user |
| Hand-rolled ensure | 0 | `sh!(..).unless(check)` or `.creates(path)` |
| Version pinning | 0 | `bin_version` fact plus the ensure combinator |
| Repo setup | 0 | `repo` primitive; one cache update per window |
| Shell for a primitive | 0 | the matching primitive (`svc`, `file`, `pkg`, `user`), not `sh` |
| Controller-side gather | 2 | `secret`, `fetch`, `local` (prepare phase) |
| Handler | 0 | a guard on the restart op; identical guarded ops merge |

#### Controller-side gather (2 tasks)

Becomes: `secret`, `fetch`, `local` (prepare phase)

- `roles/keys/tasks/main.yml:2` Read public key from controller (shell -> sh)
- `roles/keys/tasks/main.yml:7` Fetch a file on the controller (get_url -> fetch)

### By module category

| Category | Tasks | Modules | Proposed telepatch primitive |
|---|---|---|---|
| sh | 1 | shell 1 | sh |
| user | 1 | authorized_key 1 | user |
| fetch | 1 | get_url 1 | fetch |

